From 8031d47db1039e4ff4f0cc9b13c6472e88b12f82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ritesh Pandit <riteshp2001@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 11:04:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 115/140] fix(player): reanalyze black bars after stream
 changes

Invalidate crop results when source track, dimensions, or rotation changes and serialize detector cleanup.

Fixes #674
---
 .../gyrolet/mpvrx/ui/player/PlayerActivity.kt |   2 +
 .../mpvrx/ui/player/PlayerViewModel.kt        | 103 +++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 77 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/quantummpv/app/ui/player/PlayerActivity.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/quantummpv/app/ui/player/PlayerActivity.kt
index 36d73fb1..2112f89a 100644
